 he told her to go straight on for two blocks.", "pa": {"cau": "First, he told her to go straight on for two blocks.", "ipa_day_du": "/fɜːst/ /hiː/ /təʊld/ /hɜː/ /tuː/ /ɡəʊ/ /streɪt/ /ɑːn/ /fɔː/ /tuː/ /blɑːks/", "ipa_noi": "/fɜːst‿i təʊld‿ə tə ɡəʊ streɪt‿ɑːn fə tuː blɑːks/", "tho_noi": "fơst-i-tâuld-ơ-tơ-gâu-strâyt-an-fơ-tu-blaks", "tu": [{"tu": "First", "ipa": "fɜːst", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "he", "ipa": "hiː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "told", "ipa": "təʊld", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "her", "ipa": "hɜː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "to", "ipa": "tuː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "go", "ipa": "ɡəʊ", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "straight", "ipa": "streɪt", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "on", "ipa": "ɑːn", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "for", "ipa": "fɔː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "two", "ipa": "tuː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "blocks", "ipa": "blɑːks", "nguon": "cmu"}]}, "vi": "Đầu tiên, ông bảo cô đi thẳng qua hai dãy nhà."}, {"en": "Then she needed to turn left at the traffic lights.", "pa": {"cau": "Then she needed to turn left at the traffic lights.", "ipa_day_du": "/ðen/ /ʃiː/ /ˈniːdəd/ /tuː/ /tɜːn/ /left/ /æt/ /ðə/ /ˈtræfɪk/ /laɪts/", "ipa_noi": "/ðen ʃiː ˈniːdəd tə tɜːn left‿ət ðə ˈtræfɪk laɪts/", "tho_noi": "dhen-shi-nidơd-tơ-tơn-left-ơt-dhơ-trafik-laits", "tu": [{"tu": "Then", "ipa": "ðen", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "she", "ipa": "ʃiː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "needed", "ipa": "ˈniːdəd", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "to", "ipa": "tuː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "turn", "ipa": "tɜːn", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "left", "ipa": "left", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "at", "ipa": "æt", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "the", "ipa": "ðə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "traffic", "ipa": "ˈtræfɪk", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "lights", "ipa": "laɪts", "nguon": "cmu"}]}, "vi": "Sau đó, cô cần rẽ trái ở cột đèn giao thông."}, {"en": "After that, she had to go past a park and walk over a bridge.", "pa": {"cau": "After that, she had to go past a park and walk over a bridge.", "ipa_day_du": "/ˈæftə/ 